WEBVTT

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.600
But what a fine appetite you have.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.400
I'm hungry today.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.460
With the school festival trouble and the whole ghost issue,

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.160
we've had a lot going on.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.860
Yup, yup. You're both still growing,

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.730
so you need to eat well, study hard,

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.270
and fall in lots and lots of love.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.510
Oh, my, what am I saying?

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.800
You don't have to fall in lots and lots of love, of course.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.620
Even if it's just one love, if you devote yourself—

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.230
Mom!

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.510
Dinner was much appreciated!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.440
Tea, Sou-kun?

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.050
No, I'm good.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.190
The bath is ready, so you can go in first if you want.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.400
I'm fine with taking my turn later.
Please go ahead of me.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.510
Well, I'm off. I'll be in my room.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.480
Oh...

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.890
He's got that camera.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.680
Let's see. If I were to increase the shutter speed...

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.290
I see, I see.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:03.030
But even the long-lasting strife between the North and South Courts was gradually subsiding

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:08.820
by the time Takauji's grandson,
Ashikaga Yoshimitsu, became the third shogun.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:13.250
And Yoshimitsu realized the unification of North and South in...

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.750
Okay, we'll stop here today.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.010
Okay, here goes nothing.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:22.810
Kaori.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.220
Test shot.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.020
I'm just a test? How rude.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.400
Try using this formula.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.860
All right.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.320
Block him! Block him! Hey!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.170
Yeah!

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.630
Snapping photos already, I see.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.260
Eh, I don't know if I've even gotten any good shots yet.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:07.200
It's inconvenient not being able to check right away, isn't it?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.000
But I think that might be its good point, too.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.240
I get a little tense when I take a photo with this.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:16.060
There are no do-overs, so I think,
"I have to make this moment count!"

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.320
"I have to make this moment count," huh?

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.940
I'm starting to feel kind of attached to this guy.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.680
I see. Then I'm glad it's in good hands.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.740
Work on improving your technique by the school festival.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.660
Will do.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.000
Well, it'll be hard to say until I check to see how my shots turned out.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.840
Then you'd better finish the roll quickly.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:37.500
You're right.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.940
I'll do my best.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:40.760
Good luck, then.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.510
All right, Senpai...

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.380
Huh?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.450
Hey. Ever a fan of the roof, huh?

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.480
Right...

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.780
Then one more shot.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.240
Oh...

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:07.280
Oh, could it be that you hate getting your picture taken?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.490
No, it's not that I hate it...

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.220
I just felt a little scared.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.330
I feel like photos cement the passage of time.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.610
Cement the passage of time?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:20.340
Oh, please don't mind me.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:27.090
Sure, it's not nice when painful or embarrassing moments are preserved for a long time to come.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.240
But if they're good memories,

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:32.060
even you'd want to have them memorialized, wouldn't you?

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:36.440
I have no need of memories.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.800
Hey, there you are.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.820
I brought your lunch too, Sou-kun.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.570
Hey, thanks.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:47.490
I'm running on empty! My power's all gone!

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.830
I'm starving too.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.450
Much appreciated!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.800
The weather's so nice.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.960
Seriously. Makes me want to just take off for a picnic.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.090
Then why don't we have a picnic?

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.050
What?

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:10.480
Hey, now, we've got our afternoon classes.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.330
I'm kidding. Just kidding.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.020
Shall we go?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:17.980
What?

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:21.400
This <i>is</i> the perfect day for taking
that camera out for a spin, Sou-san.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.080
What a tempting incentive...

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.070
Nagisa-kun, are you serious?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.320
Huh? What?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.320
Airi-chan, what do you think?

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.690
Hmm...

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:34.280
I think you should know better than to ask me.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:35.910
In other words, "yes."
What?!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.520
Okay, then shall we go?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.560
Yeah!

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:42.250
Uh, um...

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.150
What will you do, Yui-san?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:48.050
I am not sure which option would be better.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.560
You don't have to come if you don't want to.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:52.400
I mean, you just transferred here,

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.760
so there's no reason for you to
play hooky just because we are.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:57.030
I...

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.520
If you are all going, then...

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:04.160
That is... I will come too.

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.570
Because I believe that is what I ought to do.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:11.500
Now that that's settled,
let's hurry up and go, Sou!

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:12.070
Right!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:29.850
Should we be doing this?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.440
Crap! Hurry!

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:04.750
We're almost there.

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:06.790
Right.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.150
We've finally gone and done it, huh?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.400
There's no turning back now.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:31.650
That's right.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.460
Now, where should we go?

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:56.270
How about Lighthouse Park?

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:58.430
I bet that place would have a lot of good photo spots.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:00.320
Ooh, sounds good.

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.100
All right. Let's go there.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.100
Oh, here it comes.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.000
My heart's still pounding.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.530
Mine as well. It was a rare thrill.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:20.830
Same here.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.320
What? Really?

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:25.700
I mean, I've never played hooky before.

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.400
Wow, I never would've guessed.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.590
Hey, just what kind of person do you think I am?

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.490
You're late on a regular basis,
but you've never skipped class, right?

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.720
Ahem!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.470
Wow, I never would've guessed.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.580
Why not?!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.240
No, really, Jennifer is incredible!

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:53.190
Here, look. This is her landing a triple axel!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.200
See?

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.440
Uh...

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:58.920
So cute! What a beautiful girl, right?

00:09:58.920 --> 00:09:59.910
Uh, y-yeah...

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.530
Beautiful...

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:03.690
I knew you'd appreciate it, Prez!

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:10.690
It was just incredible!

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:12.080
Senpai.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:12.280
What is it?

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.580
Everyone at the rink was on their feet!

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:13.790
You don't seem very concerned, but...

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.360
It was raining standing ovations!

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.280
Didn't we just pass Lighthouse Park?

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.640
Wow, that's amazing.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:18.170
A horde of scouts descended on her after the competition,
Didn't we just pass Lighthouse Park?

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.600
We may have.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.990
Next stop, Midoricho, first district.
A horde of scouts descended on her after the competition,

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:21.510
and she made waves all across America!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.510
Midoricho, first district

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.170
Oh! Whereabouts is Midoricho?

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.960
How much farther do you think it is?

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.730
Um... Is it possible that we passed it already?

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.420
Yes, we passed it a little while ago.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:38.300
Oops! We overshot our stop!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.990
That's what you get for telling us your stupid story!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:41.950
What?

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.880
What should we do, Airi-chan?

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.360
Hmm, I guess we can get off at the next stop.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:49.420
Nah, we've come this far—
how about we take it to the last stop?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.460
The last stop?

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.210
Well, that would work too.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:57.400
It's not as if there was someplace
we absolutely wanted to be, after all.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:00.930
OK! I guess that means we'll be
going with the flow, Nagisa-kun.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:04.090
By the way, where <i>is</i> the last stop?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.760
So this is it, huh?

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.880
Yeah! We have arrived!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.860
Hoshigaoka Ravine, huh?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.800
I never imagined we'd end up so deep in the mountains.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:24.140
It looks like it's going to be
more of a hike than a picnic.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:28.700
Hey, Sou-kun, we've been
here before, haven't we?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.250
Uh, have we?

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.600
Let's go!

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.780
That's cold!

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:57.290
This feels great!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:58.980
What?!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:00.980
Right back at you!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.320
Stop that, Kenny!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.460
Wow...

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.000
This kind of takes me back.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:15.070
So you've been here before, Kaori?

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:18.810
Yeah, back in grade school with Sou-kun.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:19.760
Wow...

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:24.010
But it doesn't look like he remembers at all.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:30.720
We used to look after Sou-kun at our place a lot,
ever since he was little,

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:34.780
and on the weekends, my mother would often
take the three of us for a drive.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:39.070
And that's how we came to this ravine
for a picnic back then.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:50.120
Kaori, Sou-kun, Mommy's going to the bathroom.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.720
Okay!

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.770
There was a time when my mother went to the bathroom

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.500
and the two of us were left on our own.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:12:59.830
I'll get something to wipe it.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:05.220
Sou-kun, it's in the bag in the back, in the pocket—

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.880
Ow!

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.540
Teddy!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.860
Kaori, wait!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:32.680
Watch out!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.200
Careful...

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:39.020
K-Kaori, you've almost got it!

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:39.960
Right!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.420
So, did you find your bear in the end?

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:58.120
No, it got swept away.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:02.110
And on top of that, I ended up with a sprain
from when I fell in the river.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:06.570
But it wasn't that serious,
so it's a good memory now.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:10.020
Hey! You having some girl talk without me?

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.360
Oh? Where's Sou?

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:14.120
He's snapping away over there.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:15.840
At this rate,

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.460
it looks like he'll use up a whole
roll of film before the day is out.

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.710
Kenny, did you see any vending machines or anything around here?

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:25.460
Uh, I feel like I saw some over
by that rest-area kind of place.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.020
All right, I'm thirsty,
so I'm gonna go buy something.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.430
Kenny, keep me company.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.870
Okay!

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.240
I'll buy enough for everyone—
whatever looks good.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.640
I'd appreciate it.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.850
I wonder how far Sou-kun's
wandered off for his photos.

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:03.630
Kaori-san?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.750
Sasaki-san!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.800
Ow...

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.840
Oh, no... What should we do?

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:15.000
I seem to recall there was a shop near the bus stop.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.910
Hopefully they have cold compresses or such.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.440
Um, I will go.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:20.060
What?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:20.810
It'll be okay.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.400
I'll go with her.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.150
You wait here.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.310
Oh...

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:36.410
Wait a minute, Yui-san.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:39.840
Are you that bothered by Kaori-san's injury?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.170
I...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:45.130
Not to mention yesterday, when Sou-san
was injured in the scuffle with the Judo Club,

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.940
you were terribly worried, weren't you?

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:49.420
I...

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.370
I may have made an error in judgment.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:56.430
If I had stopped us from coming here...

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.890
But you know, Yui-san,

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:03.730
it made me happy when you said that you would come with us.

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:05.070
Huh?

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:06.730
I'd imagine Sou-san felt the same way.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.720
Akiyama-san did? Why?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:10.780
Oh, who knows?

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.010
But don't bottle it all inside yourself.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:17.000
If there's some reason for this, please talk to me.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.740
I am sorry.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.670
I cannot say anything yet.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:25.540
I see.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:28.300
Hey.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.730
Sou-kun.

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.040
Where is everyone?

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.590
Huh? Where's your other shoe?

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.030
It got swept away by the river.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.870
Man, you klutz.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:43.310
It might still be caught on something somewhere.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:43.810
Huh?

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.690
How about we go look?

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:48.690
Okay.

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:00.580
This kind of reminds me of that one time.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.180
Huh? That one time?

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:04.940
We've come here before, right?

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:07.040
You remember?

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.590
Of course I do.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:13.400
I totally thought that you'd forgotten.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.620
Sorry about what happened back then.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:16.130
What?

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.700
For not being able to get your bear.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:23.070
After that, we decided to look for the bear

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:26.520
and the two of us walked
a long way downstream, remember?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.400
That's right, we did.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:33.280
We never did find the bear, but I was happy.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.070
Why?

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.020
Because while you were carrying me piggyback,

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:39.500
I felt like you were there for me, encouraging me.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:43.630
You were such a crybaby back then.

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.520
The same still applies now, you know.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.040
Huh?

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:52.120
I was actually happy today too—

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:55.400
during that whole time when
we were sneaking out of school

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.180
and you were pulling me along by the hand.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:01.810
It felt like we'd turned back time for a bit.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.770
Huh?

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:09.810
Where's Kaori?

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:10.970
What?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.440
No...

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.570
Calm down, Yui-san.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.520
But...

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.200
She's probably all right.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.360
What?

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.830
I find it hard to believe that Kaori-san would have gone off by herself.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:23.370
In all likelihood...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.880
Doesn't look like it's here.
Guess we should go back.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:32.340
Oh, there!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.240
Wow, we actually found it.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.080
Okay, leave it to me.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:40.010
Kaori, hold onto this.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.740
Oh... Sure.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.910
Be careful, okay?

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.400
I can't reach!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.720
Kaori!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:07.150
Hey, don't make us worry like that.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.470
Sorry.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:10.700
Airi-chan, hold onto this for me, okay?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:12.290
What? Why?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.090
Over there...

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:16.650
What? Sou? What are you doing?

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.590
My shoe's caught over there.

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.200
So I'm going to go real quick.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.010
You mustn't!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.050
Oh, Yui-chan?!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.550
I will go! Sasaki-san, you stay here.

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:26.890
Oh, Yui-chan!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.440
Furukawa?

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.740
Yui-chan...

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:48.540
Watch out!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:55.930
That was close...

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.490
Thank you very much.

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:01.040
Never mind that. Just hurry up and get the shoe!

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.190
This position is bad in so many ways!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.350
Right.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.610
All right!

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:10.430
Yes!

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:13.920
You had me sweating out of every pore.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:14.890
Sorry.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.330
But...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.320
We got Sasaki-san's shoe back.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.250
That's true.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.050
Nice combination!

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:29.680
This has truly been a trip to remember fondly.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.540
Huh? You think so?

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.180
Thank goodness.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.390
Timer's set for ten seconds!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.890
Hurry up, Sou!

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:49.180
Okay, okay!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.020
Now smile, everyone!

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.060
Say "cheese!"

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:14.010
Looks like our group shot was the last one.

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:17.240
Wow, I guess you were snapping away at a good pace.

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:20.620
Yeah. I just hope they're not out of focus.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:23.380
But I won't know until I develop them.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:33.640
I can't wait to see the finished photos.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:34.700
Yeah.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:38.110
Yui-chan's a nice girl, isn't she?

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:38.730
Yeah.

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:26.550
The Astronomy Club is coming!

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:27.940
That sounds quite romantic.

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:28.930
What are you going to do about this?!

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:30.160
Sasaki-san, what you have with Akiyama-san...

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.240
S-Stop the hell right there!

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:33.530
That's some hunky-looking takoyaki.

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:34.840
Father?!

00:23:35.730 --> 00:23:39.370
Episode five: "The Way of the Quantum Cat and the Droplet."
